    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 12:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Layár ur iri geehhouúr gawaá doorí wa ale. Layaarí a /ameenír taa tsiitiís ar tsee/amá, nee slahhaangw i baraá tsa/a'aá ya'aawós i dirii'. Nee gár gawaá sagós a slamángw tsatse/uú mibaá nee tsár. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.12.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.12.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 12:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "/Ameenirí a tsiiháy, i /aa/amiín asma asltá xwayla nee as slahha'amaayér xwayla.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.12.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.12.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 12:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.12.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.12.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 12:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Layár hatlá' iri geehhouúr gawaá doorí wa ale. Layaarí a dayshamoó yangaariír oo daa/aát. Dayshamoowí sage ngi kon a faanqw nee xareemi a mibaangw. Nee gawaá sageerose gár i kon a slam'aá faanqw. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.12.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.12.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 12:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hhaysaá dayshamoowí tsatse/uú gawaá doori nguna duuruxuné' nguri kwakwaahhiyé' baraá yaamu. Tsatse/uú taa duuruxún a bartá wák baraá baduudá' tám awa tsatse/uú doori sleémeerowo. Dayshamoodá' iri sihhiít dír geeraá /ameenidá' xwaylár slaa', as na/aywós nguwa gu/i qoomár inós bar na/aay ngwa sangw xwayluúr. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.12.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.12.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 12:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "/Ameenidá' na/oó garma guri xwayluúr. Na/aywí an kudá' xoordu sleémeero gi de'eém ar hhartá muqsli. Na/aywós kurir tláy hamtidár kilae ay amór Mungú, ay amór kitaangós kuduú aleesleemu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.12.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.12.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 12:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "/Ameenidá' iri góp ay baraá xaanxaay. Amoodae dirós kaa amohhe'eés nee Mungú as kawa amoodá' wa /aymiisi deelo kumuú wák nee tsiire tsár nee mibeeri lahhoó'.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.12.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.12.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 12:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.12.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.12.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 12:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gawaá dooriiwo slaqwara niri ti'ít. Mikaeli nee malaykeerós tari slaáqw as dayshamoodá' úr kuwa baali. Dayshamoodá' úr dinkwa nee malaykeerós tari slaáqw sleeme nee inooín. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.12.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.12.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 12:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ala dayshamoodá' nee malaykeerós taa baalinká, dir'ín iri qwát gawaá dooriiwo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.12.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.12.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 12:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dayshamoodá' úr kunguri kwaáhh, dayshamooduú aáng, kudá' ta babay oo tlaákw nee Neetlaangw. Inós an kudá' muu sleémeero gu al/agagiím. Kunguri kwaáhh baraá yaamu. Malaykeerós sleeme kingiri kwaáhh dinkwa nee inós.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.12.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.12.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 12:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.12.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.12.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 12:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aníng afór ur ngiri axaás gawaá doorí i alé, i kat, «Iimír hamí ba/ama nee /uuru nee waawuti'iima a ar Munguúrén, nee aleesleemu a oo Kristowós. Asma sakwasleemusmooduú hhaeerén kwaa yaamií kwaáhh, kudá' inooín gi sakwasleemaamuút dír geeraá Munguúrene tlaatla/aangw nee xweeraawo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.12.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.12.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 12:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inooín sakwasleemusmoodá' kuna arbaá/ ar /uuruú tseerér Deelmoó bee/i nee ar axweesantá lamabu'ungw'ín. Asma inooín slafingw'ín ngwa slai'iiká, tam gwa'ara sleeme ngaa ilaguwi'iiká. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.12.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.12.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 12:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gawaá adoorihe, kuungá' doóri, bara/é', nee kuungaásingá' sleémeero awa baraasíng wa hootá' sleeme. Kuungá' yaámu nee tláwi, a tsaxwaahúng. Asma Neetlaangw, inós naa amorhúng i aweér. Inós i ló'wa xaraasl, asma gaa xuú' adór deeloorós ar aa met kar ureeká.»",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.12.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.12.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 12:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.12.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.12.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 12:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dayshamoodá' ngiwa ár adór kura kwaáhh baraá yaamií alé, /ameenidá' na/oó garma gwa xwayluur gari gusiisín. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.12.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.12.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 12:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ala /ameenidá' kari hhampe'eeraá tsár i haniís awa gwareesidá' ur, as inós iwa /akut ay baraá xaanxaay, ay dirós tidá' inós kawa /aymaamisi qoomár kureeraá tám nee tlaqi. Didá' ka saaw dír dayshamoodae. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.12.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.12.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 12:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dayshamoodá' ma'aá adór yaae giri baraá afkós wa waá/ alaá /ameenidá' wa ale, as yaaeedá' /ameeni ngiwa hayot. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.12.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.12.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 12:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "/Ameenidá' kari alee/iís nee yaamu. Yaamu afa nguri awaatliyé', yaaeedá' ngiri gu/iyé', tidá' dayshamo aa baraá afkós wa waá/. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.12.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.12.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 12:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dayshamoodá' /ameenidá' gari i buúhh, iri slaqwarár áy dír xwaylár /ameenidá', tidá' aa met. Inooín a mukdá' hara'ayár Mungú gaa oh, nee a mukduú lamabu'úngw Yesu gu koóm. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.12.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.12.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 12:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dayshamoodá' iri sihhiít gawaá hhasángw afaá tlawi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.12.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.12.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
